From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: At30c <PabloAtsoc9993@outlook.com>
Date: Sun, 5 Oct 2026 12:05:00 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: exynos9611: M21: select the F41 camera sensor set

The M21s target is an SM-F415F (Galaxy F41), yet the universal9611 kernel
was built with the m21 defconfig, whose FIMC-IS profile is mms_v21: rear
GM2, front HI2021Q, actuator DW9808.  The stock SM-F415F ZTO boot image
that this ROM retains declares a completely different module list in its
DTBO, and those nodes are what FIMC-IS actually probes at runtime:

    gw1     position 0  id 0   (rear,  SENSOR_NAME_S5KGW1 = 62)
    imx616  position 1  id 1   (front, SENSOR_NAME_IMX616 = 121)
    gc5035  position 2  id 2
    4ha     position 4  id 3

Because CONFIG_CAMERA_CIS_GW1_OBJ and CONFIG_CAMERA_CIS_IMX616_OBJ were
unset, neither the CIS drivers nor their module wrappers were compiled.
FIMC-IS therefore could not match the module ids present in the DTBO:

    rear-camtype : module(62) is not found  -> UNKNOWN_UNKNOWN_FIMC_IS
    front-camtype: module(121) is not found -> UNKNOWN_UNKNOWN_FIMC_IS

CameraService treats an unrecognised camtype as a fatal camera error and
removes every camera, so the device reports no camera hardware at all.
The -121 (EREMOTEIO) i2c_master_send failure on the sensor EEPROM read is
the same mismatch seen from the bus side: the module that would drive the
sensor power/reset/MCLK sequence was never compiled, so the slave never
drives SCL/SDA.

Align only the camera selection with the real F41 hardware and leave every
other m21 choice untouched (SSP_M21, MALI r32p1, panel/charging and the
Android 17 compatibility backports).  This mirrors the camera block of
exynos9611-f41_defconfig exactly:

  CIS       + GW1, IMX616      - GM2, HI2021Q   (GC5035 and 4HA already y)
  actuator  + DW9817           - DW9808
  ROM      CAMERA_FXT_V41      - CAMERA_MMS_V21

CAMERA_FXT_V41 is what selects fimc-is-vendor-sensor-pwr_fxt_v41.h and
fimc-is-vender-rom-config_fxt_v41.h, which carry the F41 rails
(CAM_VLDO1..7, gpio_cam_a2p8_en) and the matching gw1/imx616/gc5035/4ha
EEPROM maps.  Enabling the CIS objects without it would still power the
wrong rails and read the wrong EEPROM blocks.

Co-developed-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 arch/arm64/configs/exynos9611-m21_defconfig | 16 ++++++++--------
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/exynos9611-m21_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/exynos9611-m21_defconfig
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/exynos9611-m21_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/exynos9611-m21_defconfig
@@ -2808,7 +2808,7 @@
 # CONFIG_CAMERA_CIS_2P8_OBJ is not set
 # CONFIG_CAMERA_CIS_2T7SX_OBJ is not set
 # CONFIG_CAMERA_CIS_2X5_OBJ is not set
-CONFIG_CAMERA_CIS_GM2_OBJ=y
+# CONFIG_CAMERA_CIS_GM2_OBJ is not set
 # CONFIG_CAMERA_CIS_3H1_OBJ is not set
 # CONFIG_CAMERA_CIS_3H1_C3_OBJ is not set
 # CONFIG_CAMERA_CIS_3J1_OBJ is not set
@@ -2832,12 +2832,12 @@
 # CONFIG_CAMERA_CIS_IMX576_OBJ is not set
 # CONFIG_CAMERA_CIS_IMX582_OBJ is not set
 # CONFIG_CAMERA_CIS_IMX586_OBJ is not set
-# CONFIG_CAMERA_CIS_IMX616_OBJ is not set
+CONFIG_CAMERA_CIS_IMX616_OBJ=y
 # CONFIG_CAMERA_CIS_SR259_OBJ is not set
 CONFIG_CAMERA_CIS_GC5035_OBJ=y
 # CONFIG_CAMERA_CIS_HI1336_OBJ is not set
-CONFIG_CAMERA_CIS_HI2021Q_OBJ=y
-# CONFIG_CAMERA_CIS_GW1_OBJ is not set
+# CONFIG_CAMERA_CIS_HI2021Q_OBJ is not set
+CONFIG_CAMERA_CIS_GW1_OBJ=y
 # CONFIG_CAMERA_CIS_IMX682_OBJ is not set
 # CONFIG_CAMERA_CIS_GD1_OBJ is not set
 # CONFIG_CAMERA_CIS_RPB_OBJ is not set
@@ -2850,14 +2850,14 @@
 # CONFIG_CAMERA_ACT_DW9780_OBJ is not set
 # CONFIG_CAMERA_ACT_DW9804_OBJ is not set
 # CONFIG_CAMERA_ACT_DW9807_OBJ is not set
-CONFIG_CAMERA_ACT_DW9808_OBJ=y
+# CONFIG_CAMERA_ACT_DW9808_OBJ is not set
 # CONFIG_CAMERA_ACT_DW9823_OBJ is not set
 # CONFIG_CAMERA_ACT_AK7372_OBJ is not set
 # CONFIG_CAMERA_ACT_LC898217_OBJ is not set
 # CONFIG_CAMERA_ACT_AK737X_OBJ is not set
 # CONFIG_CAMERA_ACT_ZC533_OBJ is not set
 # CONFIG_CAMERA_ACT_ZC569_OBJ is not set
-# CONFIG_CAMERA_ACT_DW9817_OBJ is not set
+CONFIG_CAMERA_ACT_DW9817_OBJ=y
 CONFIG_CAMERA_FLASH_SELECT=y
 # CONFIG_CAMERA_FLASH_LM3560_OBJ is not set
 # CONFIG_CAMERA_FLASH_RT5033_OBJ is not set
@@ -2919,9 +2919,9 @@
 # CONFIG_CAMERA_AAS_V50S is not set
 # CONFIG_CAMERA_MMS_V30S is not set
 # CONFIG_CAMERA_MMS_V31 is not set
-CONFIG_CAMERA_MMS_V21=y
+# CONFIG_CAMERA_MMS_V21 is not set
 # CONFIG_CAMERA_AAS_V51 is not set
-# CONFIG_CAMERA_FXT_V41 is not set
+CONFIG_CAMERA_FXT_V41=y
 # CONFIG_CAMERA_XXS_VPRO is not set
 # CONFIG_CAMERA_ATS_V04 is not set
 # CONFIG_CAMERA_MMS_V31S is not set
